        send_voice and _send_file (backing send_photo/send_document)
        duplicated the identical 5-line multipart reply_to_message_id
        field-construction block ("validate, then if defined append a
        form-data fragment") - extracted into a new
        _append_reply_to_message_id_field helper, taking the body by
        scalar ref (matching TGT-181's own established by-reference
        pattern for the same reason - the caller's own $body must
        keep accumulating fragments after the call returns). No
