        t/79-outbound-media-send.t, and
        t/49-send-message-validates-reply-id.t all pass unchanged
        (verified via a before/after full-suite diff and 100%
        statement+subroutine coverage on D2TG::Telegram.pm).

1.46  2026-09-11
