        run_once's 2-line _record_message_safe + $offset_cap
        bookkeeping pattern (introduced by TGT-178 earlier tonight)
        was duplicated identically at all 5 call sites - extracted
        into a new _record_message_and_track_offset helper, taking
        $offset_cap by scalar ref since the value must persist and
        combine across multiple calls within one run_once invocation.
        No behavior change - t/178-offset-cap-on-record-failure.t and
