      - DOC FIX (TGT-174, found via a scheduled JOB-005 doc-accuracy-hunt
        fork, immediately after TGT-173 shipped): lib/D2TG/Download.pm's
        POD still linked to L</_with_hard_timeout> (a same-document
        anchor) after TGT-173 moved that function out into D2TG::Config -
        fixed to L<D2TG::Config/_with_hard_timeout>, matching the
        already-correct cross-module link used elsewhere in the same
        file. Doc-only, no code/behavior change.

1.40  2026-09-10
