1.21  2026-09-09
      - SECURITY FIX (TGT-151, found via scheduled hourly bug hunt
        JOB-003): D2TG::Poller::run_once's message_reaction branch
        (TGT-143) ran entirely before the is_allowed access-control
        gate that guards every other inbound event - an unapproved,
        non-pending chat_id's reaction was printed unconditionally,
        leaking its chat_id/username onto the monitored stream and
        letting an unapproved party interact with the bot in a way this
