      - D2TG::Transcribe (TGT-140, external review finding confirmed live
        by Michael): the hard whisper timeout now scales with the same
        duration signal select_model already computes, instead of staying
        a flat 300s constant - a clip on its selected tier's own real
        throughput (measured: medium ran at ~5.6x real time, a 102.48s
