        the other 7 cli/*.pl scripts. extract_db_flag scans the entire
        argument list, so --db/-d can appear anywhere; the hand-rolled
        loops stopped at the first non---db/-d token. Real, user-facing
        behavior divergence for cli/send.pl (the only one of the 3 that
        also accepts other flags/positionals --db could legitimately
        follow) - 'd2 tg.send <chat_id> <file> --db myalias' previously
